	(text "01 - Power\n3V3 arrives over the GH10 cable from the Motion board (the stack's TPS63020).\nAP2127K-ADJ makes the sensor core's 1V9: Vout = 0.8 (1 + R1/R2) = 0.8 (1 + 150k/110k) = 1.89 V.\nThe PMW3360 core is specified 1.8-2.1 V; the BNO055 and the sensor I/O run from 3V3 directly." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00002-0000-4000-8000-000000000027"))
